OL,3,AIndonesia volcano eruption leaves
OL,4,A270,000 stranded as airports extend
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FJakarta's Soekarno-Hatta International
OL,8,Fand three other airports have extended
OL,9,Fclosures till 18:00 local time on
OL,10,FMonday after volcanic ash was detected
OL,11,Fin airspaces near them.
OL,13,FSchools in the region moved classes
OL,14,Fonline while some shipping operations
OL,15,Fwere also disrupted.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
